file: macros/src/dispatch.rs
breaks: One `into` target named twice, on two attributes or on one, would be the same `From` written twice, and is reported on the later, as `docs/options.md` says.
expect: killed
witness: conv=into-twice
witness: conv=into-repeated stack=second

find:
            .any(|known| spelling::spelled(&known.target) == spelled)
replace:
            .any(|known| spelling::spelled(&known.target) == spelled && false)
